  "description": "<p><em>Our Story</em> - <strong>One Happy Candle</strong> was born out of a passion and love for a beautiful, chic and luxurious lifestyle that brings an abundance of peace, love and joy into your most treasured spaces.</p>\r\n<p><strong>One Happy Candle </strong>is an ode to our founder and creator's family roots from the Caribbean island of Aruba.&nbsp; Aruba is well known in the Caribbean as the \"One Happy Island\".&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><em>Our Products</em> - <strong>One Happy Candle</strong> is a luxury home fragrance brand that strives to provide amazing and unique products that do not compromise one's health and wellness.&nbsp; As a luxury fragrance brand, part of our mission is to help our customers find ways to \"<em>Spark Your Happy\".</em></p>\r\n<p>Each candle is hand crafted and poured with rich fragrances and essential oils to create an experience of joy adding warmth and luxury to any space.&nbsp; Our fragrance oils are a high-end quality that are phthalate and paraben free blended with FBA approved soy-based wax.</p>\r\n<p><em>Our Mission</em> - It is our goal and mission that our customers commit to creating spaces for self-care, self-love, peace, joy, and all things beautiful in their kives and keep Sparking Your Happy.</p>",
